<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 6.3 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 6.3 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 6.3 percent in the week to February 5 over the equivalent year-ago week, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 6.2 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.60	  20.55	   19.38</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   2.14	  2.17	     1.74</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
